"- §6 - Proves the original goal using §7 immediately\n"
"\n"
"## Example\n"
"\n"
"If your goal is §8 and you know this follows from §9 and §10, you can write:\n"
"§11\n"
"\n"
"## Common usage\n"
"\n"
"Often used when the goal follows easily from a simpler fact, especially in contradiction proofs."
