#: Game.Levels.TutorialWorld.Level08
msgid "### Summary\n"
"\n"
"The §0 tactic tries to simplify the goal, and will solve it if possible. It acts similar to the\n"
"§1 tactic, although it is able to rewrite with many different statements many times in order to\n"
"simplify the goal. §2 will try to use all the theorems available if not told explicitly what\n"
"theorems to use.\n"
"\n"
"Using §3 will simplify only using the theorems listed.\n"
"\n"
"### Example\n"
"\n"
"If your goal is something simple like §4, §5 will know enough about the natural numbers\n"
"to solve the goal.\n"
"\n"
"### Example\n"
"\n"
"If your goal is §6, which seems\n"
"complicated, but you only need to use associativity and commutativity of addition,\n"
"§7 will solve the goal."
